AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MGPO_0002038 "An increase or decrease in the extent of number of glycan chains conjugated to proteoglycans.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:MGPO_0002038 "Former logical def:

'has part' some 
    ('altered number of'
     and ('has modifier' some abnormal)
