     and (towards some 'conjugated glycan chain'))")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:MGPO_0002038 "abnormal proteoglycan occupancy"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:MGPO_0002038 obo:MGPO_0002209)

# Class: obo:MGPO_0002039 (abnormal N-linked glycoprotein asparagine occupancy)

